⚡ Quick Tips

✅ Always test schema with real data
✅ Use {dfdl:encoding} or {dfdl:byteOrder} for dynamic behavior
✅ Avoid unsupported IBM DFDL features (e.g., stopValue)
✅ Reuse common formats using dfdl:defineFormat
